- 2026-11-08: Confirmed that changing the workspace, not merely the config
  filename, determines relative input and runtime paths. Scoped the handoff to
  local ignored inputs and reusable launch helpers; excluded authentication
  stores and private payloads from this reviewed public projection.
- 2026-11-08: Collected the ignored input bundle and consistent history backup;
  qualified both launchers and protected native startup without changing the
  original inputs or starting automation.
- 2026-11-08: Created and independently verified the reviewed issue, Project
  membership and durable backlink. Completed the bounded local handoff; the
  excluded index and ledger retain final reconciliation receipts.
